        "id": "stukov",
        "name": "Stukov"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Heroes who benefit from impassable terrain with (for example Hanzo with Scatter Arrow) or without (such as Auriel with Detainment Strike) terrain outlines can get value from Loot Hoard.\n\nWhen enemy Heroes are stuck between Hogger and impassable terrain, allied Heroes can easily follow up with Abilities that require their target to stay still for a moment (like Chromie) or inside one area for a few seconds (for example Stukov).\n\nHaving access to a high amount of damage, Hogger can be paired with another similar Bruiser to have a more solid frontline than usual. One of them (usually not Hogger because he will take care of Mercenary Camps) will be played as Offlaner whereas the other will stay in the 4-man."
  },
