        "id": "uther",
        "name": "Uther"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Try to lock Hogger in place with quick and unpredictable crowd control Abilities and then burst him down before he can get out with either Hogg Wild or Hoardapult (if selected and not on cooldown after an aggressive play). Since he has access to Armor, percent-based damage helps with that.\n\nBeing a melee Hero, Hogger does not like to play against poke damage and kite (for example Lunara), unless he can dive them with the help other Heroes.\n\nThere are some Heroes who can easily deny any value which Hogger could get with impassable terrain thanks to their mobility tools (such as Zeratul with Blink or even Medivh with Portal). Even worse, some of them can use impassable terrain against Hogger thanks to dedicated Abilities (for example Diablo with Shadow Charge).\n\nBe careful when playing against Heroes who can reduce healing (such as Ana with Biotic Grenade) because they reduce your survivability by partially or completely denying the healing provided by your chunks of Meat. The same is true for Heroes who can reduce your Spell Power, as it will decrease your self-healing too."
  },
