    "explanation": "Hogger does well on medium-sized Battlegrounds where he can double soak (such as Infernal Shrines) and is great on Maps with narrow spaces where he can get value from impassable terrain, either by Knocking back enemy Heroes towards it or by blocking enemy Heroes in small corridors (notably Cursed Hollow).\n\nBattlegrounds where most of the action happens in wide areas (for example Hanamura Temple) do not favor Hogger because he will not be able to get enough value from impassable terrain and 2-lane Maps will not allow him to dominate the early game by double soaking."
