      "description": "Hogger's Hoardapult Rage Build allows you to dive the enemy backline with the help of Hoardapult. In case of emergency, you can also use it for escaping and/or becoming Unstoppable.\n\nThe damage done by Garbage Fire at Level 7 also applies to the Loot Hoard created when using Hoardapult, so you should always pair them together.\n\nHeadbanger at Level 16 will also go off when pushing enemy Heroes towards the Loot Hoard created with Hoardapult.",
