    {
      "name": "Ez-Thro Dynamite Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "Hogger's Ez-Thro Dynamite Build makes you not only a threat for enemy Heroes who step too close but also allows you to deal poke damage from the distance, without fully committing to the team fight.\n\nDense Blasting Powder at Level 7 makes this Build particularly interesting when you can poke the enemy team, however, this Talent is also good in burst scenarios as you can hit the same Hero multiple times with it.\n\nYou should only go for this Build when playing Hogger in the 4-man because there you can easily stack Journeyman Cooking at Level 1 to increase your maximum Health and, as a consequence, how much it heals you.",
